# Omni - zellij (actions/zellij/zellij_omni.kbd)
**omni + omni**     -- Cancel
**omni + spc**      -- Space
**omni + bcsp**     -- Delete
**omni + b**        -- Page Up
**omni + c**        -- Copy
**omni + lsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + rsft + c** -- Copy Path
**omni + f**        -- Page Down
**omni + h**        -- Nav Left
**omni + j**        -- Nav Down
**omni + k**        -- Nav Up
**omni + l**        -- Nav Right
**omni + m**        -- Clipboard History
**omni + o**        -- Nav Next
**omni + p**        -- Nav Prev
**omni + q**        -- Window Close
**omni + t**        -- Tabs New
**omni + lsft + t** -- Tabs Undo Close
**omni + v**        -- Paste
**omni + w**        -- Tabs Close
**omni + x**        -- Cut
**omni + z**        -- Undo
**omni + lsft + z** -- Redo
**omni + 0**        -- Tab Goto 0
**omni + 1**        -- Tab Goto 1
**omni + 2**        -- Tab Goto 2
**omni + 3**        -- Tab Goto 3
**omni + 4**        -- Tab Goto 4
**omni + 5**        -- Tab Goto 5
**omni + 6**        -- Tab Goto 6
**omni + 7**        -- Tab Goto 7
**omni + 8**        -- Tab Goto 8
**omni + 9**        -- Tab Goto 9
**omni + ,**        -- Settings
**omni + .**        -- Tags
**omni + /**        -- Help
**omni + !lmet**    -- Desktops Toggle
**omni + !lalt**    -- Panes Toggle
**omni + !lctl**    -- Tabs Toggle
**omni + ralt**     -- Apps Toggle
**omni + prnt**     -- Groups Toggle
**omni + rctl**     -- Sessions Toggle
